for the burn. After the unlock time the owner withdraws and the page stays in the book, marked closed.\n\nThe registry has no owner, no admin key, no pause, no upgrade path and no fee. Nobody can move what you lock, and nobody can rescue it either. It is deployed at 0x27189abc36d93e456bca452d6d2bde35bb4216d6 and reading the book costs nothing.\n\nRobinhood Chain, chain id 4663, Arbitrum Orbit, EVM, gas in ETH.\n\nBurn it or lock it, the page is permanent.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://www.ponsburnbook.com/"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/ponsburnbook"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/14nyxvgr2uvydweavbykhr6u8cmjpygzm99tpecjstnk","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"14NYxvgr2UvYDWeAVBYKhR6U8cMjPYgZm99TpEcJSTNK","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/IsXXCOSqTgAiGWq8?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/JxrgyOYf7thNILIG?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/14NYxvgr2UvYDWeAVBYKhR6U8cMjPYgZm99TpEcJSTNK?timestamp=1790357700000","description":"HUGE TRADING IS OUTPERFOMING EVERYTHING?\n\nThe CEO of Coinbase has just came out and published statistics that show that Grok is leading all of Agentic AI trading volume on thier platform\n\nI've looked into it, and it's not just coinbase but all platforms that use agentic trading Grok is the main tool that is used\n\nSince Grok was introduced only 5 days ago, it's got a 59% return rate outperforming the S&P and a lot more different institutes as a investment \n\nMassive narrative and we haven't had a meme for it yet \n\nWe can pair it to SpaceX aswell!\n\n$grok - \n@grok\n make me rich no mistakes","links":[{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/genyrational/status/2103529598436909164"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/robinhood/0xdcdd7074272e9d5f6d603b71e9521762b6d35b47","chainId":"robinhood","tokenAddress":"0xdcdd7074272e9d5